# === Project ===
logs/
# The runtime data tree (inbox/, originals/, streams/, quarantine/) at the
# repository root. Anchored: an unanchored `data/` also swallows
# `backend/tests/data/`, where WP-4's committed golden FIT files live.
/data/
# ...and the same tree under `backend/`, which is where it lands whenever the
# API is run from that directory — which is how CI runs it and how CLAUDE.md
# says to reproduce the fuzz job locally. Anchored for the same reason: it must
# not swallow `backend/tests/data/`.
/backend/data/
.data-dev/
# `--report-dir` output from a local `schemathesis run`. The CI job uploads it
# as an artifact on failure; nobody should ever commit one.
schemathesis-report/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/worktrees/
**/agent-memory/

# Local docs stay untracked (see PR #6), with named exceptions that are
# shared instruments rather than working notes. `docs/*` instead of `docs/`
# because git will not re-include a file inside an ignored directory.
docs/*
!docs/agent-eval.md
